### 📋 Summary of Changes

1. **Created Tool Visibility Module**
   - Added [packages/core/src/utils/tool-visibility.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/test_large_golden_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_24944/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/core/src/utils/tool-visibility.ts) which defines:
     - `ToolVisibilityContext` (contains tool visibility & status properties).
     - `buildToolVisibilityContext(tc: any)` (builds context for a given tool/scheduler call).
     - `isRenderedInHistory(ctx)` (supercedes the legacy `shouldHideToolCall` check).
     - `belongsInConfirmationQueue(ctx)` (excludes `update_topic` as designed).
     - `isVisibleInToolGroup(ctx, verbosity)` (unifies visibility and CLI verbosity filtering).
2. **Exported visibility model on Packages Index**
   - Registered and exported the new module in [packages/core/src/index.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/test_large_golden_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_24944/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/core/src/index.ts).
3. **Removed Legacy utility**
   - Safely removed the legacy `shouldHideToolCall` and `ShouldHideToolCallParams` in [packages/core/src/utils/tool-utils.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/test_large_golden_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_24944/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/core/src/utils/tool-utils.ts).
4. **Added display model mapping**
   - Introduced `buildToolVisibilityContextFromDisplay` in [packages/cli/src/ui/utils/historyUtils.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/test_large_golden_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_24944/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/cli/src/ui/utils/historyUtils.ts) to map `IndividualToolCallDisplay` objects to the same core visibility context.
5. **Applied Visibility Logic and Confirmation Queue Filtering**
   - **Gemini Stream**: Replaced obsolete `shouldHideToolCall` with `isRenderedInHistory` in [packages/cli/src/ui/hooks/useGeminiStream.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/test_large_golden_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_24944/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/cli/src/ui/hooks/useGeminiStream.ts).
   - **Tool Group Messages**: Simplified group rendering filter logic using `isVisibleInToolGroup` in [packages/cli/src/ui/components/messages/ToolGroupMessage.tsx](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/test_large_golden_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_24944/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/cli/src/ui/components/messages/ToolGroupMessage.tsx).
   - **Queue Counting**: Integrated `belongsInConfirmationQueue` into [packages/cli/src/ui/utils/confirmingTool.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/test_large_golden_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_24944/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/cli/src/ui/utils/confirmingTool.ts) to filter out background tools like `update_topic` from interactive confirmation counts/queues.

